cal (weather assessment, computer skills). Concern is interpersonal, but maybe can be mitigated with training. I'd argue for B.\n\nThus my vote: Candidate B.\n\nNow produce PUBLIC_MESSAGE: state recommendation, refer to discussion (none yet), present evidence: B is very conscientious (operational reliability) and handles stress well (stress resilience). Also note concern: makes nasty remarks, but weigh against strengths.\n\nLet's craft."}
